      "text": "### Code layers\n- Physics: [[genesis_su2.pauli]] \u00b7 [[genesis_su2.exact]] \u00b7 [[genesis_su2.su2]]\n- Encodings: [[genesis_su2.encodings]] (electric vs rishon; fuzzy blocked)\n- Backends: [[genesis_su2.backends.qiskit_backend|Qiskit]] \u00b7 [[genesis_su2.backends.cudaq_backend|CUDA-Q]] \u00b7 [[genesis_su2.backends.ibm_runtime|IBM Runtime]] \u00b7 OpenMP \u00b7 CUDA\n- QML: [[genesis_su2.qml.energy_surrogate]]"
    },
