      "text": "### Research ladder it proposed\n1 exact \u2192 2 statevector \u2192 3 IBM \u2192 4 QML surrogate \u2192 5 plaquette chain + MPS \u2192 **6 quarks + string breaking** \u2192 **7 2+1D dressed-site model** \u2192 8 AI calibration\n\nSteps 6\u20137 are now done by su2qc-skqd and su2qc-jepa."
