      "width": 1000,
      "height": 300,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Code layers\n- Physics: [[skqd.su2]] \u2192 [[skqd.vertex]] \u2192 [[skqd.basis]] \u2192 [[skqd.hamiltonian]] (2nd route [[skqd.fullspace]]) \u2192 [[skqd.exact]]\n- Circuits: [[skqd.circuits_ir]] \u2192 Qiskit / CUDA-Q / [[skqd.quantinuum_native|Quantinuum]]; [[skqd.codec]] decoder\n- Algorithm: [[skqd.krylov]] \u2192 [[skqd.skqd]] (Ritz + certificates) \u00b7 [[skqd.controls]] \u00b7 [[skqd.ml]]\n- Device model: [[skqd.noise]] \u00b7 [[skqd.idle]] \u00b7 [[skqd.coherence]] \u00b7 [[skqd.device_req]] \u00b7 [[skqd.hardware]]"
    },
