      "id": "skqd_gates",
      "x": -1650,
      "y": -50,
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 260,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Gates (E, S, L, H, P, M series)\n34 PASS, 12 FAIL, 5 OPEN \u2014 counting every validation file, including dry runs and diagnostics\n\nExact physics E1\u2013E3 PASS \u00b7 hardware [[skqd gate H0_2x2]] PASS \u00b7 budget gates S2/S2D FAIL (criterion amended) \u00b7 [[skqd gate CF_traj]] PASS 7/7 \u00b7 6 Oct: [[skqd gate H0_ddrep]] (XY4 not replicated), [[skqd gate K1_2x3_fpilot]] (2x3 NO-GO) \u00b7 H1, H2, P1, M1 open \u00b7 QPU 327 s used, 273 s left"
    },
